flowchart LR
    Puzzles[(Train split)] --> Sample[Sample rollouts]
    Sample --> Verify{Verifier}
    Verify -->|solved| Keep[Keep shortest trace]
    Verify -->|unsolved| Hint[Oracle hint]
    Keep --> Clone[Behavior clone]
    Hint --> Clone
    Clone --> Policy[(Log-linear policy)]
    Policy -.->|next iteration| Sample
    Policy --> Greedy[Greedy decode]
    Client([Client]) --> Router[HTTP router]
    Router --> Greedy
